a, please?","incorrect_answer":"I have no tea.","explanation":"Can I have …? и более вежливое Could I have …? передают просьбу, а не утверждение."},{"id":"de1ab6ac-c03c-5d1c-8226-b256d33c3d9d","lesson_id":"f9cb9a4e-27ed-567c-ad63-afada004b272","kind":"spelling","prompt":"Собери слово «вода».","position":8,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","label":"t"},{"id":"t2","label":"e"},{"id":"t3","label":"w"},{"id":"t4","label":"r"},{"id":"t5","label":"a"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t3","t5","t1","t2","t4"]},"reference_answer":["t3","t5","t1","t2","t4"],"incorrect_answer":["t5","t1","t2","t4","t3"],"explanation":"Water пишется w-a-t-e-r."},{"id":"45e92f71-d3dd-5f30-bfd8-02fca4331394","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Как спросить, где вокзал?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Where is the station?"},{"id":"o2","label":"When station?"},{"id":"o3","label":"Who is the station?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Where спрашивает о месте; who — о человеке."},{"id":"2c1bb395-f284-5b0c-befa-b6e0f49ef145","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"matching","prompt":"Сопоставь указания направления.","position":2,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l1","label":"turn left"},{"id":"l2","label":"turn right"},{"id":"l3","label":"go straight"},{"id":"l4","label":"next to"}],"right":[{"id":"r1","label":"рядом с"},{"id":"r2","label":"идите прямо"},{"id":"r3","label":"поверните направо"},{"id":"r4","label":"поверните налево"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l1":"r4","l2":"r3","l3":"r2","l4":"r1"}},"reference_answer":{"l1":"r4","l2":"r3","l3":"r2","l4":"r1"},"incorrect_answer":{"l1":"r3","l2":"r2","l3":"r1","l4":"r4"},"explanation":"Указания turn left/right обозначают поворот, go straight — движение прямо."},{"id":"2ffc1943-35bb-5676-af87-5f81f234397a","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь вопросительное слово о месте.","position":3,"public_payload":{"sentence":"___ is the bank?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Where","where"]},"reference_answer":"Where","incorrect_answer":"Who","explanation":"Место спрашивают словом where: Where is the bank?"},{"id":"62447664-bbfe-59c6-b766-e67b9ff7ec28","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"word_order","prompt":"Составь вопрос: «Где автобусная остановка?»","position":4,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","label":"Where"},{"id":"t2","label":"bus"},{"id":"t3","label":"is"},{"id":"t4","label":"stop?"},{"id":"t5","label":"the"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t3","t5","t2","t4"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t3","t5","t2","t4"],"incorrect_answer":["t3","t5","t2","t4","t1"],"explanation":"В вопросе Where is …? связка стоит перед названием места."},{"id":"bc741472-ef9c-50c5-8cd1-a1776345b1fb","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что находится рядом с парком?","position":5,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"The school."},{"id":"o2","label":"The library."},{"id":"o3","label":"The station."}],"passage":"There is a park in our town. The library is next to the park. The bank is opposite the library. The station is far away."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Рядом с парком находится library — библиотека, а не вокзал."},{"id":"0585d780-0c1f-5974-b2d1-b41779df4b98","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"response_choice","prompt":"Ответь на вопрос о местонахождении библиотеки.","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"It is next to the park."},{"id":"o2","label":"My name is Ana."},{"id":"o3","label":"I am twelve."}],"context":"Excuse me, where is the library?"},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Вопрос Where …? требует ответа о месте."},{"id":"7f7f8ddf-682e-5e73-9afc-34007a688fe2","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь вопрос о местонахождении банка.","position":7,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Where the bank is?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Where is the bank?"]},"reference_answer":"Where is the bank?","incorrect_answer":"Where is the library?","explanation":"В прямом вопросе со связкой is порядок такой: Where is the bank? Нельзя менять bank на library."},{"id":"a60004d1-073f-57d1-bc0e-84863200607e","lesson_id":"dc2928a2-aa8b-534b-9f15-ea738abddb5c","kind":"dictation","prompt":"Прослушай короткое указание и запиши его.","position":8,"public_payload":{"text":"Turn left at the bank.","lang":"en-US"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Turn left at the bank."]},"reference_answer":"Turn left at the bank.","incorrect_answer":"Turn right at the bank.","explanation":"Turn left — поверните налево; right изменило бы направление. При отсутствии озвучки используй текст."},{"id":"ab34967d-ffef-594c-a4d1-59a7fb81903c","lesson_id":"e3ef702f-5df5-59a9-8dae-22f32b1585a9","kind":"tenses","prompt":"Выбери форму для действия, которое происходит сейчас.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"cook"},{"id":"o2","label":"cooking"},{"id":"o3","label":"is cooking"}],"sentence":"She ___ dinner now."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"После she для действия сейчас нужна полная форма is cooking."},{"id":"a68f180e-4e6d-5224-aaf8-a34c1c163806","lesson_id":"e3ef702f-5df5-59a9-8dae-22f32b1585a9","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни описание своего действия.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I ___ reading a book now."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["am"]},"reference_answer":"am","incorrect_answer":"is","explanation":"После I используется am: I am reading."},{"id":"8f2b3020-c401-5f1d-8f0b-357c6ee4f16f","lesson_id":"e3ef702f-5df5-59a9-8dae-22f32b1585a9","kind":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Выбери два грамматически верных описания действий сейчас.","position":3,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","